" - [#2]: [Hawaiian Voyaging Society](http://pvs.kcc.hawaii.edu/ike/hookele/hawaiian_star_lines.html)\n"
" - [#3]: [Imiloa](http://www.imiloahawaii.org/71/star-paths)\n"
